  "extraction_method": "article_dom",
  "body_text": "一款差点就“夭折”的产品\n向我们自己致敬，👏\n碰撞与坚持下\nSong Of Ethiopia\n11月中旬开始\n陆续在我们的三个门店限量上市出品\n这款豆子的初衷有两个版本\n版本1:\n“我们要向俄罗斯大兄弟致敬（这里说的是那个狂人牛人Dimitry）\n他在打世界冲煮赛时用了Debora的很多（可能是他找到的所有好的）豆子做了一款拼配，在呈现时也特意阐明了”我要让大家喝到全部Debora的好风味“\n这个思路简单但多么的清奇\n于是，我提议我们也做一款埃塞的组合，每一把可能都不同，但都是埃塞的好风味代表”\n版本2:\n“我们要把所有我们豆单上的埃塞做一个组合，推出一款新定义的S.O.E（起初这里是Southern Of Ethiopia）让大家喝到我们熟悉的埃塞南部产区的风味。\n最后，我们（其实整个讨论就2个人）互相妥协了下\n就有了 Song Of Ethiopia\n这款产品，不仅仅定义在意式出品，在手冲层面，也是特别想推荐给大家\n这款产品，也会是一个持续更新的组合（已经有新的埃塞测试好了哈哈哈）\n测试阶段的版本是7只埃塞\n喝过的朋友注意了哦\n接下来推出的正式版本，其实是两个\n梅龙镇和浦东店\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe G2 Washed 20%\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe Aricha Adorsi Natural 5%\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe Idido Natural 15%\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe Gotiti Washed 20%\nEthiopia Guji Uraga Washed 10%\nEthiopia Guji Uraga Natural 10%\nEthiopia Guji Uraga Super Natural 5%\nEthiopia Guji Dimtu Natural 15%\n声音小镇店\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe G2 Washed 20%\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe Aricha Adorsi Natural 5%\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe Idido Natural 20%\nEthiopia Yirgacheffe Gotiti Washed 10%\nEthiopia Guji Uraga Natural 20%\nEthiopia Guji Dimtu Natural 25%\n微店上会上架少量可对外发售库存\n有兴趣尝试的可以到微店选购\n最后，贴几个昨晚朋友发的小视频的图\n特别的精辟，非常的认同\nLast but not least, LOVE!LOVE!LOVE!\n哦对了，今年圣诞新年限定拼配 Garden Heights - “香料王国” 定型测试中\n期待一下哦",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一款差点就“夭折”的产品\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          向我们自己致敬，👏\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          碰撞与坚持下\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Song Of Ethiopia\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          11月中旬开始\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          陆续在我们的三个门店限量上市出品\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这款豆子的初衷有两个版本\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          版本1:\n         </span>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"border-style: solid;border-width: 1px 0 0;border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);-webkit-transform-origin: 0 0;-webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0 0;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          “我们要向俄罗斯大兄弟致敬（这里说的是那个狂人牛人Dimitry）\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          他在打世界冲煮赛时用了Debora的很多（可能是他找到的所有好的）豆子做了一款拼配，在呈现时也特意阐明了”我要让大家喝到全部Debora的好风味“\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这个思路简单但多么的清奇\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          于是，我提议我们也做一款埃塞的组合，每一把可能都不同，但都是埃塞的好风味代表”\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          版本2:\n         </span>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"border-style: solid;border-width: 1px 0 0;border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);-webkit-transform-origin: 0 0;-webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0 0;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          “我们要把所有我们豆单上的埃塞做一个组合，推出一款新定义的S.O.E（起初这里是Southern Of Ethiopia）让大家喝到我们熟悉的埃塞南部产区的风味。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          最后，我们（其实整个讨论就2个人）互相妥协了下\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          就有了 Song Of Ethiopia\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">\n          这款产品，不仅仅定义在意式出品，在手冲层面，也是特别想推荐给大家\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);\">\n          这款产品，也会是一个持续更新的组合（已经有新的埃塞测试好了哈哈哈）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          测试阶段的版本是7只埃塞\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          喝过的朋友注意了哦\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          接下来推出的正式版本，其实是两个\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           梅龙镇和浦东店\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Yirgacheffe G2 Washed 20%\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Yirgacheffe Aricha Adorsi Natural 5%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Yirgacheffe Idido Natural 15%\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Yirgacheffe Gotiti Washed 20%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Guji Uraga Washed 10%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Guji Uraga Natural 10%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Guji Uraga Super Natural 5%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Guji Dimtu Natural 15%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           声音小镇店\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Yirgacheffe G2 Washed 20%\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Yirgacheffe Aricha Adorsi Natural 5%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Yirgacheffe Idido Natural 20%\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Yirgacheffe Gotiti Washed 10%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Guji Uraga Natural 20%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Guji Dimtu Natural 25%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           微店上会上架少量可对外发售库存\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           有兴趣尝试的可以到微店选购\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          最后，贴几个昨晚朋友发的小视频的图\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          特别的精辟，非常的认同\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4nicRMg1IuKXODpXvDhSxbC6bY8HQBS92daBM5wOUl7fnDQxscNvvKh5qdYPjzIWgJvqgrvOxq0gWww/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-